      "id": "claim_07b0bfeb49434c23b70b3ba66f104ca6",
      "statement": "The Agents thread endpoints in thread_api.py are a thin authorized layer over LangGraph: the stream/events, commands, history, and stream endpoints proxy directly to LangGraph run APIs, and stream/events returns text/event-stream after performing auth and content-type preflight before the SSE body begins.",
